  "description": "Mistreated at an orphanage and exploited solely for her healing powers, Alvi has endured years of abuse and manipulation. But when her adoptive family leaves her for dead, a mysterious man rescues her and rewrites her tragic fate. She is whisked away to a breathtaking estate, where she discovers a shocking truth: she is the long-lost daughter of the Stewart ducal house. Now surrounded by a fiercely protective family, Alvi faces an entirely new journey. Will she be able to navigate her lingering trauma and learn to harness her magic to keep her newfound loved ones safe?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
